# These tests download a MOJO or POJO and score with it to verify that artifact scoring
# agrees with in-cluster scoring. water.EnterpriseGate now blocks that in the OSS build,
# so they cannot pass as written. The test code is intentionally kept as-is: once the
# genmodel/MOJO tooling moves to its own subrepo and ships to Enterprise customers, these
# come back and get tested properly against a build that is allowed to export.
#
# Do not "fix" these by asserting the block fires - that would delete the scoring coverage
# they exist for.


